l novel with simulation elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc97 The only streamer who will pay attention to you if you put in enough effort</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc97 Money increases the streamer's interest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc97 Your comments, especially donations during streams, will set you apart from nerds and broke-asses<br>\ud83d\udc97 She will unbox your gifts during the stream</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc97 Ask provocative questions\u2014the ones that are always on your mind<br>\ud83d\udc97 Don't abuse the dark web; in fact, it's better not to access it at all  <br>\ud83d\udc97 Mio can become your real girlfriend (yes, even you have a chance), or you might feel offended by her unavailability and end up having her targeted by haters (what if that actually helps?)<br>\ud83d\udc97 Every action you take in the game will lead you to different endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and join my stream!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988620/extras/52da47d2c9a74d89dd837fb4681ed6b7.avif?t=1755347839\" width=600 height=210 /></span>  </p>",
